<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="twoColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForTwoColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why SICAM A8000 CP-8010/12?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock two-column-article"><div class="m-t-xl two-column-article-content layout-1-to-1 two-layout-top-alignment"><div class="p-lg-r-lg"><div><p>The new compact RTU series SICAM A8000 CP-8010/12 is based on the SICAM 8 platform. Used in low-voltage and medium-voltage switchgear, it is optimized for controlling and monitoring power distribution, i.e. as distribution grid automation. The Snap‑On RGB Display CM‑8880 enables local access to diagnostic and status information as well as simple on‑site operations. </p><p>Your benefits with SICAM A8000 CP-8010/12: </p><p>• <b>Optional Display: </b>Enables fast local diagnostics and simple on-site operation directly at the device<b>.</b> </p><p>• <b>Digitalized RMU: </b>Enabling advanced monitoring and control </p><p>• <b>Mobile network communication:</b> via LTE with GPRS-fallback(available in the CP-8012) </p><p>• <b>Wireless Communication</b> </p><p>• <b>IoT connectivity: </b>Provision of data via a secure internet connection to cloud-based services and applications<b> </b></p><p>• <b>IEC 62443 &amp; IEC 62351 compliant: </b>Ensures robust cybersecurity for secure and compliant grid automation</p></div></div><div><div><div><div class="mb-4"><div class="p-0 col-sm-12 m-auto ratio ratio-16x9"><disw-video videoid="0952cbdf-d5be-403b-a400-4dfff1216fa5" locale="en-US" autoplay="false"></disw-video></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5GPA2ViNJTIo8ogWZKebQr' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_3' data-ste-section-id='5GPA2ViNJTIo8ogWZKebQr'>
